  "chapter": {
    "number": 60,
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "hebrew_subtitle",
        "content": [
          "(61) For the end, among the Hymns of David."
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 1,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "O God, listen to my petition; attend to my prayer.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "From the ends of the earth have I cried to you, when my heart was in trouble: you lifted me up on a rock you did guide me:",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "because you were my hope, a tower of strength from the face of the enemy.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 4,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "I will dwell in your tabernacle for ever; I will shelter myself under the shadow of your wings. Pause.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 5,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "For you, o God, have heard my prayers; you have given an inheritance to them that fear your name.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 6,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "You shall add days to the days of the king; you shall lengthen his years to all generations.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 7,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "He shall endure for ever before God: which of them will seek out his mercy and truth?",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 8,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "So will I sing to your name for ever and ever, that I may daily perform my vows.",
            "poem": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "footnotes": []
  },
